    {
      "text": "Illustration of a tablet computer displaying a mock-up of a WHO web page, with the WHO logo, a photo of health workers and a woman holding a child in a pharmacy setting, and placeholder bars for text. It accompanies the link to the WHO self-care health topic page.",
      "lang": "en",
      "state": "draft",
